flowchart TB
  cli[record CLI: writer validation / lock / ACL]
  file[(toolchain-ledger.json)]
  cli --> file
  subgraph reader[lib/factory/toolchain-ledger.mjs]
    path[defaultToolchainLedgerPath<br/>call-time environment]
    read[readToolchainLedger<br/>file safety / JSON / schema]
    result[value or unavailable<br/>no state writes]
    read --> result
  end
  path --> callers[v2 / v4 / v5 scan<br/>v5 finalize]
  callers -- resolved path --> read
  file -- read-only --> read
  result --> projection[wire-owned projection<br/>legacy and v5 semantics retained]
  projection --> report[existing report / same-report finalize]
